        "UNR-RULE-0008",
        "UNR-RULE-0009",
        "UNR-RULE-0023",
        "UNR-RULE-0037"
      ],
      "reason": "A trained skill55+ may be explicitly selected once as specialty; advantage/disadvantage cancel; follower chooses own cost; ordinary attempt pays additional action time; push rerolls one prior failed check without duplicate base duration; supply cost uses owned consumable; plans may add only a fixed loan item; no prior facts rewritten."
    },
    {
      "id": "T0P-KNOWLEDGE",
      "status": "PROTOTYPE",
      "parent_rules": [
        "UNR-RULE-0022",
        "UNR-RULE-0033",
        "UNR-RULE-0039"
      ],
      "reason": "Only fixed source facts with actual own observation can be verified by GM before settlement. Archive awards the existing abnormal-study+2 once. GM selects one prepared potentially false world note per actual pollution increase, retaining private provenance; no arbitrary secret text release."
    }
